Subject: [RFC PATCH v2 23/35] ACPI: Warn when the present bit changes but the feature is not enabled
Date: Wed, 13 Sep 2023 16:38:11 +0000
Message-Id: <20230913163823.7880-24-james.morse@arm.com>
